<title>CHINA: Sincere Co year profit jumps sharply.</title>
<headline>Sincere Co year profit jumps sharply.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended February 28</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   4.3	vs  0.2</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    4.0	vs  3.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil	vs  6.64 gain</p>
<p>    Net			    24.75    vs  1.16</p>
<p>    Turnover		     1,261.16 vs  978.43</p>
<p>    Company name		 Sincere Co Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  August 14-22</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   August 28</p>
<p>NOTE - Sincere operates department stores and has subsidiaries in property investment, restaurants and insurance.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is four H.K. cents vs three cents.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
